Package: SLspatial
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Data for Sri Lanka
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Amalan",
      family = "Mahendran",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "amalan0595@gmail.com"
    )
  )
Description: Provides spatial datasets representing administrative and
    electoral boundaries in Sri Lanka. The package includes administrative
    divisions, electoral polling divisions, and their associated district
    classifications. Spatial data are provided as simple features ('sf')
    objects to support geographical visualisation, spatial analysis,
    and integration with electoral and administrative datasets.
URL: https://github.com/Amalan-ConStat/SLspatial,https://amalan-constat.github.io/SLspatial/
BugReports: https://github.com/Amalan-ConStat/SLspatial/issues
